"PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 38 of them. In 2025 the middle ran 43% of normal in August to September and 46% in September to October. So far in 2026 it went the other way, with March to April at 172% on the middle. Grid 22941 had its driest year in 1953 at 56%.</p>"}
